"AWSTemplateFormatVersion: '2010-09-09'\nTransform: AWS::Serverless-2016-10-31\nDescription: 'Serverless Bank Management System built using AWS SAM, Lambda, API Gateway,\n  Cognito and DynamoDB.\n\n  '\nGlobals:\n  Function:\n    Runtime: nodejs24.x\n    Timeout: 30\n    MemorySize: 256\n    Architectures:\n    - x86_64\nResources:\n  CustomersTable:\n    Type: AWS::DynamoDB::Table\n    Properties:\n      TableName: customers\n      BillingMode: PAY_PER_REQUEST\n      AttributeDefinitions:\n      - AttributeName: customerId\n        AttributeType: N\n      - AttributeName: cognitoSub\n        AttributeType: S\n      KeySchema:\n      - AttributeName: customerId\n        KeyType: HASH\n      GlobalSecondaryIndexes:\n      - IndexName: CognitoSubIndex\n        KeySchema:\n        - AttributeName: cognitoSub\n          KeyType: HASH\n        Projection:\n          ProjectionType: ALL\n    Metadata:\n      SamResourceId: CustomersTable\n  AccountsTable:\n    Type: AWS::DynamoDB::Table\n    Properties:\n      TableName: accounts\n      BillingMode: PAY_PER_REQUEST\n      AttributeDefinitions:\n      - AttributeName: accountId\n        AttributeType: N\n      - AttributeName: customerId\n        AttributeType: N\n      KeySchema:\n      - AttributeName: accountId\n        KeyType: HASH\n      GlobalSecondaryIndexes:\n      - IndexName: CustomerIdIndex\n        KeySchema:\n        - AttributeName: customerId\n          KeyType: HASH\n        Projection:\n          ProjectionType: ALL\n    Metadata:\n      SamResourceId: AccountsTable\n  TransactionsTable:\n    Type: AWS::DynamoDB::Table\n    Properties:\n      TableName: transactions\n      BillingMode: PAY_PER_REQUEST\n      AttributeDefinitions:\n      - AttributeName: transactionId\n        AttributeType: N\n      - AttributeName: accountId\n        AttributeType: N\n      KeySchema:\n      - AttributeName: transactionId\n        KeyType: HASH\n      GlobalSecondaryIndexes:\n      - IndexName: AccountIdIndex\n        KeySchema:\n        - AttributeName: accountId\n          KeyType: HASH\n        Projection:\n          ProjectionType: ALL\n    Metadata:\n      SamResourceId: TransactionsTable\n  NotificationsTable:\n    Type: AWS::DynamoDB::Table\n    Properties:\n      TableName: notifications\n      BillingMode: PAY_PER_REQUEST\n      AttributeDefinitions:\n      - AttributeName: notificationId\n        AttributeType: N\n      - AttributeName: customerId\n        AttributeType: N\n      KeySchema:\n      - AttributeName: notificationId\n        KeyType: HASH\n      GlobalSecondaryIndexes:\n      - IndexName: CustomerIdIndex\n        KeySchema:\n        - AttributeName: customerId\n          KeyType: HASH\n        Projection:\n          ProjectionType: ALL\n    Metadata:\n      SamResourceId: NotificationsTable\n  PendingMaintenancesTable:\n    Type: AWS::DynamoDB::Table\n    Properties:\n      TableName: pendingmaintenances\n      BillingMode: PAY_PER_REQUEST\n      AttributeDefinitions:\n      - AttributeName: accountId\n        AttributeType: N\n      - AttributeName: customerId\n        AttributeType: N\n      KeySchema:\n      - AttributeName: accountId\n        KeyType: HASH\n      GlobalSecondaryIndexes:\n      - IndexName: CustomerIdIndex\n        KeySchema:\n        - AttributeName: customerId\n          KeyType: HASH\n        Projection:\n          ProjectionType: ALL\n    Metadata:\n      SamResourceId: PendingMaintenancesTable\n  BankUserPool:\n    Type: AWS::Cognito::UserPool\n    Properties:\n      UserPoolName: BankManagementUserPool\n      UsernameAttributes:\n      - email\n      Policies:\n        PasswordPolicy:\n          MinimumLength: 8\n          RequireUppercase: true\n          RequireLowercase: true\n          RequireNumbers: true\n          RequireSymbols: true\n      Schema:\n      - Name: role\n        AttributeDataType: String\n        Mutable: true\n        StringAttributeConstraints:\n          MinLength: '1'\n          MaxLength: '20'\n    Metadata:\n      SamResourceId: BankUserPool\n  BankUserPoolClient:\n    Type: AWS::Cognito::UserPoolClient\n    Properties:\n      ClientName: BankManagementAppClient\n      UserPoolId:\n        Ref: BankUserPool\n      GenerateSecret: false\n      ExplicitAuthFlows:\n      - ALLOW_USER_PASSWORD_AUTH\n      - ALLOW_REFRESH_TOKEN_AUTH\n      PreventUserExistenceErrors: ENABLED\n    Metadata:\n      SamResourceId: BankUserPoolClient\n  AdminUserGroup:\n    Type: AWS::Cognito::UserPoolGroup\n    Properties:\n      GroupName: ADMIN\n      Description: Bank administrators\n      UserPoolId:\n        Ref: BankUserPool\n      Precedence: 1\n    Metadata:\n      SamResourceId: AdminUserGroup\n  CustomerUserGroup:\n    Type: AWS::Cognito::UserPoolGroup\n    Properties:\n      GroupName: CUSTOMER\n      Description: Bank customers\n      UserPoolId:\n        Ref: BankUserPool\n      Precedence: 2\n    Metadata:\n      SamResourceId: CustomerUserGroup\n  CreateCustomerFunction:\n    Type: AWS::Serverless::Function\n    Properties:\n      FunctionName: BankManagement-CreateCustomerFunction\n      CodeUri: s3://aws-sam-cli-managed-default-samclisourcebucket-taqlkhwc37bf/BankManagementSystem-Serverless/8a8bce94c14e156a28dbdbe04a3ef234\n      Handler: createCustomer.handler\n      Environment:\n        Variables:\n          CUSTOMERS_TABLE:\n            Ref: CustomersTable\n          COGNITO_APP_CLIENT_ID:\n            Ref: BankUserPoolClient\n          USER_POOL_ID:\n            Ref: BankUserPool\n          NODE_OPTIONS: ' --enable-source-maps'\n      Policies:\n      - Statement:\n        - Effect: Allow\n          Action:\n          - dynamodb:Scan\n          - dynamodb:PutItem\n          Resource:\n            Fn::GetAtt:\n            - CustomersTable\n            - Arn\n        - Effect: Allow\n          Action:\n          - cognito-idp:AdminConfirmSignUp\n          - cognito-idp:AdminAddUserToGroup\n          Resource:\n            Fn::GetAtt:\n            - BankUserPool\n            - Arn\n      Events:\n        RegisterCustomer:\n          Type: Api\n          Properties:\n            RestApiId:\n              Ref: BankManagementApi\n            Path: /customers\n            Method: POST\n    Metadata:\n      BuildMethod: esbuild\n      BuildProperties:\n        Bundle: true\n        EntryPoints:\n        - src/functions/customers/createCustomer.ts\n        Format: cjs\n        Minify: false\n        Sourcemap: true\n        Target: es2022\n      SamResourceId: CreateCustomerFunction\n  GetCustomersFunction:\n    Type: AWS::Serverless::Function\n    Properties:\n      FunctionName: BankManagement-GetCustomersFunction\n      CodeUri: s3://aws-sam-cli-managed-default-samclisourcebucket-taqlkhwc37bf/BankManagementSystem-Serverless/ed888615d023a010fe41e7cff397feb8\n      Handler: getCustomers.handler\n      Environment:\n        Variables:\n          CUSTOMERS_TABLE:\n            Ref: CustomersTable\n          NODE_OPTIONS: ' --enable-source-maps'\n      Policies:\n      - DynamoDBReadPolicy:\n          TableName:\n            Ref: CustomersTable\n      Events:\n        GetCustomers:\n          Type: Api\n          Properties:\n            RestApiId:\n              Ref: BankManagementApi\n            Path: /customers\n            Method: GET\n            Auth:\n              Authorizer: BankCognitoAuthorizer\n              AuthorizationScopes:\n              - aws.cognito.signin.user.admin\n    Metadata:\n      BuildMethod: esbuild\n      BuildProperties:\n        Bundle: true\n        EntryPoints:\n        - src/functions/customers/getCustomers.ts\n        Format: cjs\n        Minify: false\n        Sourcemap: true\n        Target: es2022\n      SamResourceId: GetCustomersFunction\n  GetCustomerByIdFunction:\n    Type: AWS::Serverless::Function\n    Properties:\n      FunctionName: BankManagement-GetCustomerByIdFunction\n      CodeUri: s3://aws-sam-cli-managed-default-samclisourcebucket-taqlkhwc37bf/BankManagementSystem-Serverless/6279ee7b3786098097f8f0b6f192c146\n      Handler: getCustomerById.handler\n      Environment:\n        Variables:\n          CUSTOMERS_TABLE:\n            Ref: CustomersTable\n          ACCOUNTS_TABLE:\n            Ref: AccountsTable\n          NODE_OPTIONS: ' --enable-source-maps'\n      Policies:\n      - DynamoDBReadPolicy:\n          TableName:\n            Ref: CustomersTable\n      - Statement:\n        - Effect: Allow\n          Action:\n          - dynamodb:Query\n          Resource:\n            Fn::Sub: ${AccountsTable.Arn}/index/CustomerIdIndex\n      Events:\n        GetCustomerById:\n          Type: Api\n          Properties:\n            RestApiId:\n              Ref: BankManagementApi\n            Path: /customers/{customerId}\n            Method: GET\n            Auth:\n              Authorizer: BankCognitoAuthorizer\n              AuthorizationScopes:\n              - aws.cognito.signin.user.admin\n    Metadata:\n      BuildMethod: esbuild\n      BuildProperties:\n        Bundle: true\n        EntryPoints:\n        - src/functions/customers/getCustomerById.ts\n        Format: cjs\n        Minify: false\n        Sourcemap: true\n        Target: es2022\n      SamResourceId: GetCustomerByIdFunction\n  EditCustomerFunction:\n    Type: AWS::Serverless::Function\n    Properties:\n      FunctionName: BankManagement-EditCustomerFunction\n      CodeUri: s3://aws-sam-cli-managed-default-samclisourcebucket-taqlkhwc37bf/BankManagementSystem-Serverless/0977496ce3c8566c9633e6e28fe89aee\n      Handler: editCustomer.handler\n      Environment:\n        Variables:\n          CUSTOMERS_TABLE:\n            Ref: CustomersTable\n          NODE_OPTIONS: ' --enable-source-maps'\n      Policies:\n      - DynamoDBCrudPolicy:\n          TableName:\n            Ref: CustomersTable\n      Events:\n        EditCustomer:\n          Type: Api\n          Properties:\n            RestApiId:\n              Ref: BankManagementApi\n            Path: /customers/{customerId}\n            Method: PUT\n            Auth:\n              Authorizer: BankCognitoAuthorizer\n              AuthorizationScopes:\n              - aws.cognito.signin.user.admin\n    Metadata:\n      BuildMethod: esbuild\n      BuildProperties:\n        Bundle: true\n        EntryPoints:\n        - src/functions/customers/editCustomer.ts\n        Format: cjs\n        Minify: false\n        Sourcemap: true\n        Target: es2022\n      SamResourceId: EditCustomerFunction\n  DeleteCustomerFunction:\n    Type: AWS::Serverless::Function\n    Properties:\n      FunctionName: BankManagement-DeleteCustomerFunction\n      CodeUri: s3://aws-sam-cli-managed-default-samclisourcebucket-taqlkhwc37bf/BankManagementSystem-Serverless/38cccde3bdd25eb4212666d27337e9e4\n      Handler: deleteCustomer.handler\n      Environment:\n        Variables:\n          CUSTOMERS_TABLE:\n            Ref: CustomersTable\n          ACCOUNTS_TABLE:\n            Ref: AccountsTable\n          NODE_OPTIONS: ' --enable-source-maps'\n      Policies:\n      - DynamoDBCrudPolicy:\n          TableName:\n            Ref: CustomersTable\n      - DynamoDBCrudPolicy:\n          TableName:\n            Ref: AccountsTable\n      Events:\n        DeleteCustomer:\n          Type: Api\n          Properties:\n            RestApiId:\n              Ref: BankManagementApi\n            Path: /customers/{customerId}\n            Method: DELETE\n            Auth:\n              Authorizer: BankCognitoAuthorizer\n              AuthorizationScopes:\n              - aws.cognito.signin.user.admin\n    Metadata:\n      BuildMethod: esbuild\n      BuildProperties:\n        Bundle: true\n        EntryPoints:\n        - src/functions/customers/deleteCustomer.ts\n        Format: cjs\n        Minify: false\n        Sourcemap: true\n        Target: es2022\n      SamResourceId: DeleteCustomerFunction\n  LoginCustomerFunction:\n    Type: AWS::Serverless::Function\n    Properties:\n      FunctionName: BankManagement-LoginCustomerFunction\n      CodeUri: s3://aws-sam-cli-managed-default-samclisourcebucket-taqlkhwc37bf/BankManagementSystem-Serverless/9c0b690d208a137d5f43df427d5b6399\n      Handler: loginCustomer.handler\n      Environment:\n        Variables:\n          COGNITO_APP_CLIENT_ID:\n            Ref: BankUserPoolClient\n          NODE_OPTIONS: ' --enable-source-maps'\n      Events:\n        LoginCustomer:\n          Type: Api\n          Properties:\n            RestApiId:\n              Ref: BankManagementApi\n            Path: /login\n            Method: POST\n    Metadata:\n      BuildMethod: esbuild\n      BuildProperties:\n        Bundle: true\n        EntryPoints:\n        - src/functions/login/loginCustomer.ts\n        Format: cjs\n        Minify: false\n        Sourcemap: true\n        Target: es2022\n      SamResourceId: LoginCustomerFunction\n  CreateAccountFunction:\n    Type: AWS::Serverless::Function\n    Properties:\n      FunctionName: BankManagement-CreateAccountFunction\n      CodeUri: s3://aws-sam-cli-managed-default-samclisourcebucket-taqlkhwc37bf/BankManagementSystem-Serverless/8de2c06af3a1c8b283f3b293d4013df4\n      Handler: createAccount.handler\n      Environment:\n        Variables:\n          ACCOUNTS_TABLE:\n            Ref: AccountsTable\n          NODE_OPTIONS: ' --enable-source-maps'\n      Policies:\n      - Statement:\n        - Effect: Allow\n          Action:\n          - dynamodb:Scan\n          - dynamodb:PutItem\n          Resource:\n            Fn::GetAtt:\n            - AccountsTable\n            - Arn\n      Events:\n        CreateAccount:\n          Type: Api\n          Properties:\n            RestApiId:\n              Ref: BankManagementApi\n            Path: /accounts\n            Method: POST\n            Auth:\n              Authorizer: BankCognitoAuthorizer\n              AuthorizationScopes:\n              - aws.cognito.signin.user.admin\n    Metadata:\n      BuildMethod: esbuild\n      BuildProperties:\n        Bundle: true\n        EntryPoints:\n        - src/functions/accounts/createAccount.ts\n        Format: cjs\n        Minify: false\n        Sourcemap: true\n        Target: es2022\n      SamResourceId: CreateAccountFunction\n  GetAccountsFunction:\n    Type: AWS::Serverless::Function\n    Properties:\n      FunctionName: BankManagement-GetAccountsFunction\n      CodeUri: s3://aws-sam-cli-managed-default-samclisourcebucket-taqlkhwc37bf/BankManagementSystem-Serverless/140908d361f234f9e60e2d63615edb3d\n      Handler: GetAccounts.handler\n      Environment:\n        Variables:\n          CUSTOMERS_TABLE:\n            Ref: CustomersTable\n          ACCOUNTS_TABLE:\n            Ref: AccountsTable\n          NODE_OPTIONS: ' --enable-source-maps'\n      Policies:\n      - Statement:\n        - Effect: Allow\n          Action:\n          - dynamodb:Query\n          Resource:\n          - Fn::Sub: ${CustomersTable.Arn}/index/CognitoSubIndex\n          - Fn::Sub: ${AccountsTable.Arn}/index/CustomerIdIndex\n        - Effect: Allow\n          Action:\n          - dynamodb:Scan\n          Resource:\n            Fn::GetAtt:\n            - AccountsTable\n            - Arn\n      Events:\n        GetAccounts:\n          Type: Api\n          Properties:\n            RestApiId:\n              Ref: BankManagementApi\n            Path: /accounts\n            Method: GET\n            Auth:\n              Authorizer: BankCognitoAuthorizer\n              AuthorizationScopes:\n              - aws.cognito.signin.user.admin\n    Metadata:\n      BuildMethod: esbuild\n      BuildProperties:\n        Bundle: true\n        EntryPoints:\n        - src/functions/accounts/GetAccounts.ts\n        Format: cjs\n        Minify: false\n        Sourcemap: true\n        Target: es2022\n      SamResourceId: GetAccountsFunction\n  BankManagementApi:\n    Type: AWS::Serverless::Api\n    Properties:\n      Name: BankManagementAPI\n      Description: Bank Management REST API\n      StageName: prod\n      EndpointConfiguration: REGIONAL\n      Cors:\n        AllowMethods: '''GET,POST,PUT,DELETE,OPTIONS'''\n        AllowHeaders: '''Content-Type,Authorization'''\n        AllowOrigin: '''*'''\n      Auth:\n        Authorizers:\n          BankCognitoAuthorizer:\n            UserPoolArn:\n              Fn::GetAtt:\n              - BankUserPool\n              - Arn\n            Identity:\n              Header: Authorization\n    Metadata:\n      SamResourceId: BankManagementApi\nOutputs:\n  CustomersTableName:\n    Description: Customers DynamoDB Table\n    Value:\n      Ref: CustomersTable\n  AccountsTableName:\n    Description: Accounts DynamoDB Table\n    Value:\n      Ref: AccountsTable\n  TransactionsTableName:\n    Description: Transactions DynamoDB Table\n    Value:\n      Ref: TransactionsTable\n  NotificationsTableName:\n    Description: Notifications DynamoDB Table\n    Value:\n      Ref: NotificationsTable\n  PendingMaintenancesTableName:\n    Description: Pending Maintenances DynamoDB Table\n    Value:\n      Ref: PendingMaintenancesTable\n  BankUserPoolId:\n    Description: Cognito User Pool ID\n    Value:\n      Ref: BankUserPool\n  BankUserPoolClientId:\n    Description: Cognito App Client ID\n    Value:\n      Ref: BankUserPoolClient\n  AdminGroupName:\n    Description: Cognito Administrator Group\n    Value:\n      Ref: AdminUserGroup\n  CustomerGroupName:\n    Description: Cognito Customer Group\n    Value:\n      Ref: CustomerUserGroup\n  CreateCustomerFunctionArn:\n    Description: Create Customer Lambda ARN\n    Value:\n      Fn::GetAtt:\n      - CreateCustomerFunction\n      - Arn\n  GetCustomersFunctionArn:\n    Description: Get Customers Lambda ARN\n    Value:\n      Fn::GetAtt:\n      - GetCustomersFunction\n      - Arn\n  GetCustomerByIdFunctionArn:\n    Description: Get Customer By ID Lambda ARN\n    Value:\n      Fn::GetAtt:\n      - GetCustomerByIdFunction\n      - Arn\n  EditCustomerFunctionArn:\n    Description: Edit Customer Lambda ARN\n    Value:\n      Fn::GetAtt:\n      - EditCustomerFunction\n      - Arn\n  DeleteCustomerFunctionArn:\n    Description: Delete Customer Lambda ARN\n    Value:\n      Fn::GetAtt:\n      - DeleteCustomerFunction\n      - Arn\n  LoginCustomerFunctionArn:\n    Description: Login Customer Lambda ARN\n    Value:\n      Fn::GetAtt:\n      - LoginCustomerFunction\n      - Arn\n  BankManagementApiId:\n    Description: Bank Management API Gateway ID\n    Value:\n      Ref: BankManagementApi\n  BankManagementApiUrl:\n    Description: Bank Management API Gateway Invoke URL\n    Value:\n      Fn::Sub:\n      - https://${ApiId}.execute-api.${AWS::Region}.amazonaws.com/prod\n      - ApiId:\n          Ref: BankManagementApi\n"
